  "changelog": "Initial release of connector-hub: a centralized entry point and registry for 33 connectors across three layers.\n\n- Three-level classification (platform-level, auth-convenient, pure API query) and decision tree for connector selection.\n- Each connector has its own reference documentation and executable scripts with clear prefix rules.\n- Complete Skill-based replacement solutions offered where possible; irreplaceable connectors are marked with reasons.\n- Unified registry tables covering use cases in documentation, messaging, storage, enterprise info, finance, code hosting, project management, and business services.\n- Trigger words provided for quick access and integration scenarios.",
